<!-- CLOSING -->
<section class="content-section alt" id="disclaimer-closing">
    <div class="content-wrapper">
        <h2>A Word from Brother Aaron</h2>
        <p>
            I love the Church I belong to. I equally love the people who do not belong to
            it&mdash;whether they are seeking God or not. This ministry exists to stand in
            the common ground between them and say plainly what I have come to know of
            Jesus Christ.
        </p>
        <p>
            But standing in common ground requires knowing where I stand&mdash;and where I do
            not. I do not stand in the office of any apostle, prophet, or presiding officer
            of the Church. I do not stand between you and the Savior. I do not stand over
            you as an authority on doctrine or policy. I stand beside you as a fellow
            disciple who has been asked to bear witness of what he has seen and heard.
        </p>
        <p>
            This disclaimer is simply my attempt to say all of that plainly, so that nothing
            you find here is ever mistaken for what it is not.
